NOTE, and this is the point of the feature: at t+5s the agent's own
self-reported `addresses` list still reads 10.99.0.2 (stale, captured at
register time) while `remoteIP` reads 10.99.0.55. The displayed IP is
server-observed and independent of what the agent reports about itself.

